  "published": "2026-09-25T14:29:39.957Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Three new rules: LC057 reports Min, Max and Average over a non-nullable value that throw when an EF Core query matches no rows; LC058 reports a TransactionScope without TransactionScopeAsyncFlowOption.Enabled that spans an await; LC059 reports disposing the connection from Database.GetDbConnection(), which the DbContext owns. LC058 and LC059 join the critical preset. LC007 now follows same-project helper methods that run a query inside a loop. False positives found by scanning real apps are fixed in LC002, LC007 (batch drain loops), LC008 (in-memory queries through locals and helpers), LC009 (entities returned inside a tuple), LC011 (method-group builders and C# 14 extension blocks), LC015 (re-sorting an ordered Take window) and LC035 (filters through locals, loops and caller flow), and an LC035 build hang is fixed. LinqContraband.Scan no longer fails on repositories that raise every analyzer diagnostic to an error, such as an LC031 finding breaking the scan build.",
